{
  "description": "This protocol performs a nucleic acid purification protocol based on the MagneSil Plasmid Purification System from Promega.\n\n\nTo purchase tips, reagents, or pipettes, please visit our online store or contact our sales team at info@opentrons.com\n\nOpentrons OT-2\nOpentrons OT-2 Run App (Version 3.15.0 or later)\nOpentrons Magnetic Module\nOpentrons P300 Multi-Channel Pipette\nOpentrons 50/300µL Tips\nEppendorf Deep Well Plate 500µL\nEppendorf Deep Well Plate 2000µL\nCorning 96-Well Plate, 360µL\nUSA Scientific 12-Well Reservoir, 22mL\nReagents\nSamples\n\n\n\nSlot 1: Opentrons 50/300µL Tips](https://shop.opentrons.com/collections/opentrons-tips/products/opentrons-300ul-tips)\nSlot 2: Opentrons 50/300µL Tips, if needed\nSlot 3: Opentrons 50/300µL Tips, if needed\nSlot 4: Opentrons 50/300µL Tips, if needed\nSlot 5: Opentrons 50/300µL Tips, if needed\nSlot 6: Opentrons 50/300µL Tips, if needed\nSlot 7: Opentrons 50/300µL Tips, if needed\nSlot 8: Corning 96-Well Plate\nSlot 9: Eppendorf Deep Well Plate 500µL, with samples\nSlot 10: Opentrons Magnetic Module with Eppendorf Deep Well Plate 2000µL\nSlot 11: USA Scientific 12-Well Reservoir\n A1: Resuspension Buffer\n A2: Lysis Solution\n A3: Neutralization Buffer\n A4: MagneSil Blue\n A5: MagneSil Red\n A6: 80% Ethanol Solution\n* A7: Elution Buffer",
